# Testing Guidelines for DLQ Project

See `docs/TESTING.md` for full details.

- Use `cargo-nextest`: `cargo nextest run --release` runs everything (doctests: `cargo test --release --doc`).
- Unit tests live in `#[cfg(test)]` modules under `src/`; CLI end-to-end tests live in `crates/dlq-cli/tests/`.
- Tests that need SQS must use `dlq::test_utils::SqsTestEnv` (ElasticMQ via testcontainers, or
  `DLQ_TEST_SQS_ENDPOINT` for a shared server). Create queues with `env.create_queue(prefix)` so
  names are unique and tests can run in parallel. Never hardcode endpoints or shell out to the `aws` CLI.
- Do not configure retries by default; fix flaky tests instead.
